Common reasons for 404 or failure

You left the placeholder YOUR_KEY unchanged.
You used the wrong URL format/endpoint (e.g., typos, wrong network subdomain).
You accessed with HTTP GET in a browser (Infura expects JSON-RPC POST).
The Infura project was deleted, disabled, or its network access is blocked by project settings or billing.
If you tried to use Project Secret in the URL incorrectly — use provider auth or HTTP basic auth rather than appending the secret in the path.
