PowerShell-safe apply-erethum-docs replacement script This is the safe docs-only refactor that:
creates branch docs/rename-erethum
edits tracked .md, .txt, .csv files only
does word-boundary replacements: TOKEN -> ERETHUM Token -> Erethum tokens -> erethum token -> erethum
